# Open Sole heading size (HARD)

Andrew 2026-10-07: every section heading on Open Sole is the **same size**.

Standard: **56px / 36px / 400 / line-height 1.06 / letter-spacing -0.032em**.

Lock: `planning/locks/OPEN-SOLE-HEADING-SIZE-LOCKED.md`

- Scope only `template.suffix == 'in-studio-template'`
- Do not change Home, Closed Sole, or collections heading CSS
- Do not set Hold every pose `heading_size_override` back to `0`
- Do not change the product h1, buy box, copy, images, or mobile text pads 96/96
